# Format: URL | YEAR | STATUS (pending/done/error)
# Add CSV data source URLs here, one per line.
# The pipeline processes the smallest pending year first.
#
# Example:
# https://data.example.com/hospital-data-2020.csv | 2020 | pending
# https://data.example.com/hospital-data-2021.csv | 2021 | pending
# https://data.example.com/hospital-data-2022.csv | 2022 | pending
